msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "Taiga「......What are you doing here?」"
msgstr "Taiga「......¿Qué haces aquí?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Waiting for you.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Esperándote.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「This isn't about breakfast.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No se trata del desayuno.」"

msgid "Taiga「Then what is it? School's about to＿start, so I don't have time to sit and＿talk with you.」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Entonces qué es? Las clases están por＿empezar, así que no tengo tiempo para＿sentarme a hablar contigo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......It's about Kushieda.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Es sobre Kushieda.」"

msgid "Taiga「About Minorin?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Sobre Minorin?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí.」"

msgid "Taiga「What about her?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Qué pasa con ella?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I don't like Kushieda anymore.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ya no me gusta Kushieda.」"

msgid "Taiga「Wha-- What the hell are you saying!?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¿Q-- Qué demonios estás diciendo?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I may have had feelings for her in the＿past, but I don't feel that way right＿now.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Puede que sintiera algo por ella＿en el pasado, pero ahora mismo＿ya no me siento así.」"

msgid "Taiga「That was because you had amnesia,＿right!? ......Once you've remembered＿everything about Christmas......!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Eso fue porque tenías amnesia,＿¿verdad?! ......¡Ahora que recordaste＿todo sobre Navidad......!」"

msgid "Taiga「What's wrong with you? It's like you're＿saying it's Minorin's fault!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Qué te pasa? ¡Es como si estuvieras＿diciendo que es culpa de Minorin!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I'm not. That's not it. The real issue is＿probably compatibility. It's not a＿matter of whose fault it is.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No lo digo. No es eso. El verdadero＿problema quizá sea la compatibilidad. No＿es cuestión de quién tenga la culpa.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「If it's possible to fall in love with＿someone, it's possible to fall out of＿love, too.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Si es posible enamorarse de alguien,＿también es posible desenamorarse.」"

msgid "Taiga「That might be true...... but--!」"
msgstr "Taiga「Eso puede ser cierto...... ¡pero--!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You didn't think anything of Kitamura＿at first, right? Not nearly as much as＿you do now.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Al principio no sentías nada＿por Kitamura, ¿verdad? Ni de＿lejos tanto como ahora.」"

msgid "Taiga「............」"
msgstr "Taiga「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「But you fell in love with him. The＿opposite has happened to me.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Pero te enamoraste de él. A mí＿me ha pasado lo contrario.」"

msgid "Taiga「......Then it's all been for nothing? You＿were so desperately passionate about＿her!」"
msgstr "Taiga「......¿Entonces todo fue para＿nada? ¡Si estabas perdidamente＿enamorado de ella!」"

msgid "Taiga「And now you're saying it's all been＿meaningless!?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¿Y ahora dices que todo＿eso no tuvo sentido?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「..................」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「..................」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I want to continue being friends with＿Kushieda, same as always.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Quiero seguir siendo amigo de＿Kushieda, igual que siempre.」"

msgid "Taiga「Wh...... What the...... What......?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Q...... Qué...... Qué......?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「But don't worry! I'll still help you with＿Kitamura, like we promised.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Pero no te preocupes! Seguiré＿ayudándote con Kitamura, como＿prometimos.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「My feelings may be in the past, but＿yours for Kitamura......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Mis sentimientos serán del pasado,＿pero los tuyos por Kitamura......」"

msgid "Taiga「Screw that!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¡Al diablo con eso!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Gurgh!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Guh!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Out of nowhere she threw a straight＿right punch to my stomach......!）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¡De la nada me lanzó un derechazo＿directo al estómago......!）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「T-The hell are you doing......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Q-Qué demonios haces......?」"

msgid "Taiga「I'm disgusted! Thoroughly disgusted! I＿never thought you were that kind of＿person!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Qué asco! ¡Me das un asco terrible!＿¡Nunca pensé que fueras esa clase＿de persona!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Taiga...... you...... hit me full force......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Taiga...... me...... golpeaste＿con toda tu fuerza......」"

msgid "Taiga「Hmph! Just kick the bucket right＿there, why don't you!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Jum! ¡¿Por qué no te mueres＿ahí mismo de una vez?!」"

msgid "Taiga「Tch!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Tch!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「*Sigh*...... I practiced how I'd phrase it,＿but maybe it was too serious......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「*Suspiro*...... Practiqué cómo＿decirlo, pero quizá sonó demasiado＿serio......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「But at least I said what I needed to......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Pero al menos dije lo que＿tenía que decir......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Still............ It hurts......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Aun así............ Duele......）」"

msgid "Taiga「Why? Don't tell me you're mad about＿me not coming over for breakfast＿again. I'll say it again - like I said」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Por qué? No me digas que estás molesto＿otra vez porque no voy a desayunar.＿Lo diré de nuevo: como」"

msgid "Taiga「before, I'm doing what I want.」"
msgstr "Taiga「dije antes, hago lo que quiero.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「At the test of courage we did a while＿back, I talked with Kushieda the whole＿time, and in doing so I learned」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「En la prueba de valor que hicimos hace＿un tiempo, hablé con Kushieda todo el＿rato, y al hacerlo aprendí」"

msgid "Ryuuji「something.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「algo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Kushieda is amazingly easy to talk to,＿and an incredibly nice person, but it's＿like...... I never felt all \"nervous\" around」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Es facilísimo hablar con Kushieda, y es＿muy buena persona, pero es como......＿nunca me puse \"nervioso\" con」"

msgid "Ryuuji「her.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「ella.」"

msgid "Taiga「Don't like Minorin!? Idiot! Talk to me＿after you've really thought it through!＿There's no way you don't like her」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¿Ya no te gusta Minorin?! ¡Idiota!＿¡Háblame cuando lo hayas pensado bien!＿¡Es imposible que hayas dejado de」"

msgid "Taiga「anymore!」"
msgstr "Taiga「quererla!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「But love isn't dependent on memories.＿People change. Even if I liked Kushieda＿a year ago, she's changed now. Am I」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Pero el amor no depende de recuerdos.＿La gente cambia. Aunque Kushieda me＿gustara hace un año, ya cambió. ¿No」"

msgid "Ryuuji「right?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「tengo razón?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I don't think it was meaningless. I＿thought of Kushieda in my own way......＿and did everything the best I could.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No creo que no tuviera sentido. Pensé＿en Kushieda a mi manera...... e hice＿todo lo mejor que pude.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Besides......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Además......」"
